h height, various ranges of weights, and the numerical rating debits or credits at the bottom of each chart column.", "reference": "1983, J. David Cummins, Barry D. Smith, R. Neil Vance, Jack L. VanDerhei, Risk Classification in Life Insurance (Huebner International Series on Risk, Insurance, and Economic Security; 1), Dordrecht: Springer, →DOI, →ISBN, page 132:"}], "synonyms": [], "antonyms": [], "translations": [{"language": {"code": "bg", "name": "Bulgarian"}, "word": "телосложе́ние"}, {"language": {"code": "nl", "name": "Dutch"}, "word": "bouw"}, {"language": {"code": "fi", "name": "Finnish"}, "word": "ruumiinrakenne"}, {"language": {"code": "fr", "name": "French"}, "word": "carrure"}, {"language": {"code": "ka", "name": "Georgian"}, "word": "აგებულება"}, {"language": {"code": "ka", "name": "Georgian"}, "word": "აღნაგობა"}, {"language": {"code": "de", "name": "German"}, "word": "Bau"}, {"language": {"code": "de", "name": "German"}, "word": "Körperbau"}, {"language": {"code": "ga", "name": "Irish"}, "word": "déanamh"}, {"language": {"code": "ga", "name": "Irish"}, "word": "cruth"}, {"language": {"code": "mi", "name": "Māori"}, "word": "hanga"}, {"language": {"code": "nb", "name": "Norwegian Bokmål"}, "word": "bygning"}, {"language": {"code": "nb", "name": "Norwegian Bokmål"}, "word": "kroppsbygning"}, {"language": {"code": "pl", "name": "Polish"}, "word": "budowa ciała"}, {"language": {"code": "pt", "name": "Portuguese"}, "word": "físico"}, {"language": {"code": "ru", "name": "Russian"}, "word": "телосложе́ние"}, {"language": {"code": "gd", "name": "Scottish Gaelic"}, "word": "dèanamh"}, {"language": {"code": "sk", "name": "Slovak"}, "word": "postava"}, {"language": {"code": "es", "name": "Spanish"}, "word": "complexión"}, {"language": {"code": "es", "name": "Spanish"}, "word": "complixión"}, {"language": {"code": "es", "name": "Spanish"}, "word": "contextura"}, {"language": {"code": "sv", "name": "Swedish"}, "word": "byggnad"}, {"language": {"code": "sv", "name"